    "compact-4.2bsd-1983::escape_leaf_for_unseen_symbols_followed_by_the_raw_byte_and_a_split_insert"
   ],
   "fitness_value_in_ancestor": "one pass over the input; the decoder replays the same updates so no tree is transmitted",
   "failure_landscape": "by reading: the exchange logic is written against a compiler quirk ('change code when Cory gets v. 7'); the pointer juggling through union treep is the fragile part",
